Visa requirements for Canadian citizens for visits to various territories, disputed areas, partially recognized countries, and restricted zones:

;Africa
*{{flag|British Indian Ocean Territory}} — special permit required.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.fco.gov.uk/en/travel-and-living-abroad/travel-advice-by-country/asia-oceania/british-indian-ocean-territory?ta=entryRequirements&pg=4 | title=British Indian Ocean Territory travel advice - GOV.UK|website=fco.gov.uk | access-date=29 June 2017}}</ref>
* {{flag|Eritrea}} (outside [[Asmara]]) — visa covers [[Asmara]] only; to travel in the rest of the country, a Travel Permit for Foreigners is required (20 [[Eritrean nakfa]]).<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.eritrea.be/MoT.htm | title=Ministry of Tourism - Tourism Service Center | first=Hans van der|last=Splinter|website=www.eritrea.be|access-date=29 June 2017}}</ref>
* {{flag|Mayotte}} — Visa not required for 90 days with a 180-day period.
* {{flag|Réunion}} — Visa not required for 90 days within a 180-day period.
*{{SHN}}
**{{flag|Ascension Island}} — e-Visa for 2 months within any year period<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.ascension-visas.com|title=Ascension Island E-Visa System|date=13 November 2018}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.ascension-island.gov.ac/entry-visas/|title=Entry Visas|date=13 November 2018|access-date=19 November 2018|archive-date=19 June 2019|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190619085843/https://www.ascension-island.gov.ac/entry-visas/|url-status=dead}}</ref>
**{{flag|Saint Helena}} — Visitor's Pass granted on arrival valid for 4/10/21/60/90 days for 12/14/16/20/25 [[pound sterling]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.sthelenatourism.com/the-island/useful-info/|title=Useful info - St Helena Tourism|access-date=17 November 2013|archive-date=9 July 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170709030558/http://sthelenatourism.com/the-island/useful-info/|url-status=dead}}</ref>
**{{flag|Tristan da Cunha}} — Permission to land required for 15/30 [[pound sterling|pounds sterling]] (yacht/ship passenger) for Tristan da Cunha Island or 20 [[pound sterling|pounds sterling]] for [[Gough Island]], [[Inaccessible Island]] or [[Nightingale Islands]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.tristandc.com/visitsadmin.php|title=Tristan da Cunha Tourism|first=Richard|last=Grundy|website=www.tristandc.com|access-date=29 June 2017}}</ref>
*{{flag|Sahrawi Arab Democratic Republic}} ([[Free Zone (region)|Western Sahara controlled territory]]) — undefined visa regime.
