*{{flag|Iraqi Kurdistan}} - You can apply for an e-Visa (30 days) to visit the Iraqi Kurdistan Region.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://visit.gov.krd | title=Iraqi Kurdistan e-Visa}}</ref>
*{{flag|Macau}} — Visa not required for 30 days.<ref>{{Timatic|nationality=CA|destination=MO|accessdate=26 November 2013}}</ref>
